WEBVTT

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.170
Greetings, everyone!

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:45.500
Starting today, all of Kamizono Academy has switched to summer uniforms.

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:48.890
Aren't summer uniforms great?

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:52.840
The sense of freedom, the white blouse sparkling under the sun,

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:57.000
the quick glimpses of skin from underneath the thinner than usual fabric...

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.300
Making the body and the soul feel all the more light...

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:03.890
...wait, why have we been using Shishimaru as the image?!  He's not <i>moe</i> at all!

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:07.320
Senpai, calm down!  Kyougoku-senpai!

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:09.950
You do it, at least!  You do it!

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:10.770
Me?

00:02:11.050 --> 00:02:12.250
Just do it...

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:14.730
Oh no, no no...

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.390
Greetings, everyone!

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:21.030
Starting today, all of Kamizono Academy has switched to summer uniforms.

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:23.180
Aren't summer uniforms great?

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:27.790
The sense of freedom, the white blouse sparkling under the sun,

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.460
the quick glimpses of skin from underneath the thinner than usual fabric...

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:34.170
Making the body and the soul feel all the more light...

00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:37.330
Senpai!

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:40.020
Oh, sorry... Kinda lost control there.

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:42.390
It's not like anyone wants my picture...

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.730
T-That's not true.

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:45.970
Senpai?

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.270
Okay!

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:55.030
Henceforth, we're executing the Kamizono Academy Summer Configuration (Unofficial) Live Photo Shoot!

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:56.060
Yeah!

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:57.030
Follow me!

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.030
Yessah!

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:05.110
For Photoshop Yanagi, this new merchandise is indispensably crucial for summer sales.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.490
Photoshop Yanagi

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:06.330
Take that to heart.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:12.730
I borrowed the best camera from the photography club, too.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:14.290
Nice work.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:19.950
Moneymoneymoneymoneymoneymoneymoneymoneymoneymoney...

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.200
Yanagi.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.980
Sounds like fun.  Cut me in.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:02.260
They call him "the fox." (kitsune)

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:07.370
This guy here knows a thing or two.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:11.690
Kitsune-senpai?

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.750
Is that your name?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:16.360
That's my name.  And you?

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.010
I'm Kobayashi.

00:04:18.010 --> 00:04:19.390
What's your first name?

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:20.600
Koma.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:25.110
Nice.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.700
Not as nice as...

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.770
First year?

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:28.770
Yes.

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:31.920
But, what strange wind blew you here?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.780
Are you interested in this sort of stuff?

00:04:33.780 --> 00:04:36.960
No, this is just a good way to kill time.

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.590
Hey, this is our <i>job</i>.

00:04:39.890 --> 00:04:42.590
Fine, I got it.  I won't get in your way.

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:46.260
There they are, Senpai!  Targets acquired!

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:50.790
Is that kind of photo any good?

00:04:51.440 --> 00:04:53.180
We've got orders.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:56.960
People asked us to take pictures of people they admire.

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:02.570
It sure is full of cool and cute people, isn't it?

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:04.950
Prepare yourself, Kobayashi-kun!

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:06.280
I'd have it no other way!

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.540
Look at 'em go.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.940
So, did we achieve our objectives?

00:05:30.940 --> 00:05:32.620
Not bad, I'd say.

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.600
Class 1-6's Makunouchi, eh?

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:38.880
She's one of those yankee types, but one should not take that as a negative.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.070
In fact, she is quite the radiant beauty.

00:05:41.070 --> 00:05:41.820
And...

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.780
A chance smile!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:46.300
Her hidden charm bubbling up...

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:48.060
Quite the dark horse.

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:52.330
You seemed in a good mood, but I didn't expect you to be this passionate.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.480
Your skills have improved, Kobayashi-kun.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:56.160
How about yours, Senpai?

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.210
That's...

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.620
Meganekko...

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:00.690
Always the fan favorite.

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:03.010
I'll tell you the easy method...

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:08.220
Whether you can capture the beauty of the crease between the eyebrows or not...

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:09.810
That's the ticket!

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:11.080
It is?

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.140
I will take it to heart.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:17.430
And in the instant the meganekko ventures to take off her glasses, it's what they call an "off shot"!

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:19.680
If you can't grasp that, then what can you grasp?

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:21.270
Beats me.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.360
Still a little rough, I'd say.

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.890
We can handle the cutting when it's time to print them.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:30.640
When you truly "capture the moment," you're going to get rough ones, too.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.930
Halation:  blurring the edges of a picture

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:32.930
And there is always halation!

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:34.110
I see.

00:06:34.110 --> 00:06:35.330
I don't get it.

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:46.700
That's 1-6's Nonomura Ayumi!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:47.590
Now's our chance!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:51.020
Whoozat?

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:53.390
One of the popular first years.

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.360
It's true...

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:05.050
Her face has "please bully me" written all over it.

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:06.400
What are you talking about?

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:09.530
Ooh, I want to see her cry...

00:07:09.820 --> 00:07:13.020
Ki... Kitsune-senpai?

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:14.950
Please stop it!

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:17.630
Yeah, this guy's a real S (sadist).

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:18.420
An "S?"

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:20.230
Yes, I'm an S.

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:26.400
Guess this is it.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:27.780
Yeah.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:35.100
It'd be nice if I could get a shot of something a little less... ordinary.

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:37.270
Yanagi.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:40.270
In that case, leave it to me.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.230
Hey...

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:47.410
I've stuck with you this far, I might as well do some work.

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:51.730
H-Hey!

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:53.110
What's he planning?

00:07:53.110 --> 00:07:54.070
Dunno...

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.890
They have a new pudding!

00:07:58.890 --> 00:07:59.950
Really?

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:05.790
Okay, I'll see you in class...

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.970
Just a little joke.

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:33.970
Laters.

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.180
"A little joke?"

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:49.900
Flipping up a girl's skirt?

00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:54.970
Man, you're unbelievably crazy.

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:57.620
Not that I'm complaining...

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.970
You liked that, eh?

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.320
Yeah...

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:05.060
Well, yeah, but I can't sell these!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.440
You can't?

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.930
Too bad, I suppose.

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:09.360
Yeah, too bad indeed.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:12.660
Then, give them to me.  Payment for today's work.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:14.450
I'll use 'em.

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.140
What do you mean, use them?

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.630
Curious?

00:09:17.630 --> 00:09:19.410
Um... Nevermind.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.120
I'll tell you all about it.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.250
I said nevermind!

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:23.780
The first letter is...

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.010
Enough!

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:25.790
Ah!

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.480
It's not "A."

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:28.770
It's Tora-chan.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:35.220
There, there...

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:40.390
Perfect!  I can get a shot for Shishimaru.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.520
What?  What about Shishimaru?

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:44.660
You didn't know?

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:46.270
Didn't know <i>what</i>?

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:50.570
He's... in love.

00:09:50.570 --> 00:09:53.190
Seems he's fallen in love with that girl.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.030
A good match, don't you think?

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:00.600
For real?  Shishimaru?!  For real?

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.740
What this about me now?

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:04.620
Oh, Shishimaru.

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:07.120
What are you guys doing here?

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.640
That's...

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:20.400
T-Torako-chan!

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:22.200
Torako-chan!

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:23.550
Keep your head down!

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:26.590
What the heck are you people doing?

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:28.840
Well, it's all for your sake, see, Senpai.

00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:30.850
Yeah, right, for <i>your sake</i>.

00:10:31.990 --> 00:10:33.320
Are you for real?

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:35.830
I mean, is this like, bona fide.

00:10:35.830 --> 00:10:37.130
What are you talking about?

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:43.890
Yanagi, were you going to take Torako-chan's...

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.080
With that...

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:48.950
Yeah, just about to.

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:51.760
Take her picture?

00:10:52.310 --> 00:10:53.760
Yeah.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:56.420
I see. You'll take her picture.

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:58.820
Yes, I will.

00:10:58.820 --> 00:10:59.860
In her summer uniform?

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.540
Y-Yeah...

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:02.900
In her summer uniform?!

00:11:02.900 --> 00:11:05.010
Yes, in her summer uniform... So?

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:07.320
Why, you...

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:11.480
You plan on taking secret photos of my girl in her summer uniform?!

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.000
Shishimaru?

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:13.940
Senpai?

00:11:15.700 --> 00:11:18.740
Her soft summer smile, sparkling like the sun!

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:25.370
And the glimpses of her fit, supple body underneath her fresh new uniform!

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:29.710
You seriously think that your vulgar self can capture such radiance in your viewfinder?!

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.380
I won't allow it!

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:31.200
How many lenses?

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.290
How many lenses does that reflex camera have?!

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.190
Tell me!

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:36.580
I got it!  I got it!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:39.300
So, I guess you don't need a picture of her this time, right?

00:11:44.830 --> 00:11:46.300
No, I need one.

00:11:47.510 --> 00:11:49.100
I want a picture!

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:53.060
However!  I will not forgive you for taking a secret picture!

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:02.730
Hello!

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.750
Can we take your picture?

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.500
Shishimaru, you wimp.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:10.290
At least ask her yourself!

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:14.010
How about it?

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:15.480
Hey.

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.750
Oh, Torako-san.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:21.380
Ni...

00:12:25.030 --> 00:12:26.370
Niichan...

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:42.520
I'm Torako's big brother, Kageyama Kitsune.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.840
I do not see a resemblance.

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.480
Not even close.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.810
I want to eat some ramen.

00:12:51.810 --> 00:12:54.960
What do you want?  I'm already heading home...

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.910
Huh?  What's that?

00:12:56.910 --> 00:13:00.340
Is that any way to talk to your dear brother?

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:04.600
Torako, this is the first time we've run into each other since you started here, isn't it?

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:07.050
Trying to avoid us, are we?

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:12.230
N-No... The grades are just split up into different buildings, that's all.

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:14.230
Oh, it's that jerk from before.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:15.510
Jerk?

00:13:15.510 --> 00:13:17.120
What do you mean, jerk?

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:19.450
Just before, you see...

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.120
I'm being serious here!

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.740
Just before...

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:25.530
Her panties?

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:26.970
That's right, her panties.

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:28.360
He's a skirt flipper.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.900
Panties?  Oh, yeah, back during lunch.

00:13:31.900 --> 00:13:33.720
What about panties?

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.460
This jerk took a look at Nonomura's panties.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:38.350
Nonomura-kun's panties?!

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:39.190
These.

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:40.570
Jesus!

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:42.730
President!

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:44.510
And then you took a picture of Ayumi's panties?!

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:46.970
What?  Ayu's panties?!

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:49.640
You idiot!  What were you thinking?

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.850
Apologize to Ayu, and her panties, too!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:55.800
Sorry 'bout peeking at your panties there, Ayumi-chan.

00:13:58.010 --> 00:13:59.600
Ayumi-tan's panties...

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:03.900
Um... Could you stop screaming "panties, panties" so much?

00:14:03.900 --> 00:14:06.670
I'm really sorry.  Here, take this as my apology.

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:07.960
Look...

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:11.740
It's Torako's pant-

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:19.540
Thank you sir, may I have another?

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:31.890
He's the worst!  The complete pits!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:33.390
He's always been like this.

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:34.390
From the very beginning!

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:37.970
All my brother ever does is bully me!

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:39.600
From the beginning?

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.060
He takes me favorite food.

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:46.610
He ties my shoelaces into giant knots.

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:50.650
He changes all the recordings scheduled on the TV to baseball!

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:51.310
Why?

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:55.590
And if I try and disobey him he pays me back ten-fold.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:00.850
Even Suzu won't save me.

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:04.730
So you knew about him, Suzume-san.

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:05.840
Yeah.

00:15:08.260 --> 00:15:11.040
Kitsune always gives me candy so I like him.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:15.010
And what about all the candy I give you?!  What about that?  You damn glutton!

00:15:20.750 --> 00:15:22.680
I just can't get enough of that face!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:23.560
You S.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.230
It's hilarious!  For sure!  My stomach hurts from laughing!

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:31.630
So that's your little sister.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.280
You don't look anything like her, though.

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:36.190
God forbid I would.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:38.800
I guess it's obvious if you look at your last names.

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:41.250
Hey, Kitsune.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:49.300
Should I be calling you "Onii-san?"

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.080
Not so fast!

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:52.840
You're thinking too far ahead!

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:56.200
But seriously, you called Torako "cute?"

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.430
Are your eyes even open?

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:03.100
Say what?!  Torako-chan is cute!  Of course she's cute!

00:16:03.100 --> 00:16:08.280
Why don't you try opening those slitty eyes of yours and take a fresh look at your sister yourself!

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.560
Take a fresh look!

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:17.230
Will you back me up on this?

00:16:17.640 --> 00:16:20.810
Back you up?  Like how?

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:22.880
I dunno... You're her brother, right?

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.500
You could do a lot of stuff.

00:16:25.490 --> 00:16:29.010
What a bunch of bull.  No way, man.

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:30.980
Just a pain in the ass.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.930
So I said, but let's give it a go.

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.350
Hey, Torako.

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:45.440
After all, this might be pretty funny.

00:16:46.070 --> 00:16:47.520
Yo, let's eat together.

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:50.490
W-Wait, Kitsu-

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.050
Here, hurry and sit down.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:58.080
Whatcha eatin'?

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.630
Ramen.

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.110
What kind of ramen?

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:02.530
Soy sauce.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:06.100
What is it?

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.320
So, alone today?

00:17:08.990 --> 00:17:10.670
Everyone else will come later.

00:17:11.400 --> 00:17:13.540
So get the hell out of here.

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:14.760
I see.  I see.

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:18.940
What should I do next?

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:24.430
This guy's frozen stiff!

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:27.500
How am I supposed to follow him like this?

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:31.060
What a pain this has turned out to be.

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:40.040
Isn't that Hannibal Lecter cooking in the kitchen?

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.090
N-No way!

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:44.760
Hey, putting that sort of stuff in the food is dangerous!

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:46.250
Where, where?

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.230
Dr. Lecter isn't back there...

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.090
Spicy...

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.220
Niichan!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.260
Ki-Kitsune!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:01.890
Don't leave me here!

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:09.900
Hey!

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:14.840
Damn, I ended up playing my usual pranks.

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:25.310
Hey.

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:27.080
If it isn't Torako-san's elder brother.

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:33.190
Oh, hey.

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:35.280
Will you kindly step aside?

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.660
Torako is waiting for us.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:38.370
Uh, sure, but...

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:40.320
Kitsune, you're in the way.

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:42.480
Do you have some business with us?

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:43.930
Come with me for a bit.

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.180
What is it?

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:48.680
What am I doing?

00:18:51.850 --> 00:18:54.630
Kitsune, this isn't what I wanted!

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:56.190
What should I do?

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:58.920
I can't even eat this anymore.

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.070
So much for my soy sauce ramen.

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.280
Soy sauce ramen...

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:06.330
Would you switch with mine?

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:30.270
You'd switch with me?

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:39.190
Was that my fault?

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:43.920
Um, what was it you wanted?

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:53.830
Show me your panties again.

00:19:56.640 --> 00:19:57.960
Just a little joke.

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:28.280
Yo.

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:53.410
I just had lunch with Torako.

00:20:56.790 --> 00:20:57.830
Oh?

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:08.200
Hitsugi, do you want me to take your picture?

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:12.090
Do you want me to take your picture?

00:21:12.090 --> 00:21:14.620
You have a camera with you, Yagi-chan?

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:18.390
My big brother forgot his cell phone at home.

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:21.370
Your brother's in the high school, right, Yagi-chan?

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:22.240
Yeah.

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:24.140
You sure you shouldn't bring it to him?

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:26.370
The high school is far away.

00:21:26.370 --> 00:21:29.800
But back to my question:  Do you want me to take your picture or not?

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.020
But that's your brother's...

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:34.860
This... This might be our only chance!

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:36.640
Then, okay.

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:45.150
Oh, the battery's dead.

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.470
Sorry, maybe another time.

00:23:21.710 --> 00:23:23.290
What's on Hyakko next week?

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:27.210
It's a two parter:  "An Arrow Stuck in a Tiger", and "I Drew a Tiger, but it Ended Up a Pussycat."

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:28.300
It's some kind of scary story?

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:29.260
Why do you think that?

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:30.510
Well there was a thriller like thing just...

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:31.720
Please stop it, Yagi-chan!

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:33.590
Look forward to next time too!
